  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1-preview.24\n- Adds the Uno Platform integration for Firebase Firestore. UseUno() delegates to the platform package that matches the Uno head the application is running on: Firestore.Browser on WebAssembly, Firestore.Android on Android, Firestore.Apple on iOS and Mac Catalyst, and Firestore.Windows on Windows.\n- The package references no Uno package and stays framework-independent, exactly as the .Maui packages reference no MAUI package. The head is detected at runtime, so the browser and Skia-desktop heads share the plain net10.0 asset.\n- Fails fast with UnoFirestoreException on the Skia desktop head, including Linux, because FireForNet ships no desktop integration packages.",
